bch\af4\loch\f20 Granted, that view was probably accurate in 1995.  Today, \hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 Apache is a viable platform and provides the basis for many \hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 web-centric \hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 business solutions.\par \par \hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 Many businesses \hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 are utilizing Microsoft-centric \hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 software simply because they d\hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 on\rquote t know of any other way to do it.  There are other ways, some easier, some harder, but other ways and many of them worthwhile.\par \par \hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 Besides being a Webmaster and Systems Programmer, I teach Internet technologies at a two-year college and many students eithe\hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 r say \ldblquote I\rquote ve never heard of Apache\rdblquote  or \ldblquote I seen it and it\rquote s way too hard for me to pick-up; I\rquote m used to the point and click environment.\rdblquote \hich\f20   Well, we all must start somewhere \u8230\'c9\par \par \hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 I feel that Apache is a perfect candidate to choose when implementing many busines\hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 s-centric solutions and a good tool to know \endash  whether you are an Internet developer, Webmaster, or general all-around technologist \endash  at all skill levels.  \par \par \hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 The following topics will be discussed during this session:\par }\pard\plain \ri-720\widctlpar\adjustright \loch\af4\hich\af4\dbch\f4\cgrid {\fs22 \par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs22\loch\af3\hich\af3\dbch\f4 \loch\af3\dbch\af4\hich\f3 \u-3913\'b7\tab}}\pard \fi-360\li360\ri-720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls3\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxtb \'b7}}\ls3\adjustright {\fs22 \hich\af20\dbch\af4\loch\f20 What is Apache?\line \par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs22\loch\af3\hich\af3\dbch\f4 \loch\af3\dbch\af4\hich\f3 \u-3913\'b7\tab}}\pard \fi-360\li360\ri-720\widctl